# Keep Out, first mode: "Keep Out deals 4 damage to target tapped creature." Bot2 attacks with one of its two Ornithopters on
# turn 4, so that one is tapped and the other is not. At Bot2's end step Bot1 cannot aim the mode at the untapped Ornithopter, and
# its 4 damage kills the tapped one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Keep Out
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter#1.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter#1 > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Keep Out.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Keep Out deals 4 damage)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Keep Out
